        model:ClassDeclaration ;
    schema1:comment "The independently named value type of urn:silmaril:aob:#tsBitWidth. Its semantic parent is urn:silmaril:prim:#NaturalWithoutZero; the role remains distinct from other fields sharing that parent. The source range is retained separately for an explicit conversion gate. This nominal declaration does not admit a host literal or provide conversion or physical byte-closure evidence." ;
